1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,143
This war ended a
thousand years ago.

2
00:00:02,163 --> 00:00:03,877
Why are people still
dying?

3
00:00:03,897 --> 00:00:04,937
Meet the Seam War.

4
00:00:04,957 --> 00:00:06,539
It ended in one
truce.

5
00:00:06,559 --> 00:00:08,440
The lazy version:
the war ends,

6
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:09,883
and everyone moves
on.

7
00:00:09,903 --> 00:00:10,898
Press run.

8
00:00:10,918 --> 00:00:12,265
Ten centuries pile
on.

9
00:00:12,285 --> 00:00:13,115
The war sinks.

10
00:00:13,135 --> 00:00:14,042
Forgotten.

11
00:00:14,062 --> 00:00:16,451
A war nobody feels
is just a date.

12
00:00:16,471 --> 00:00:18,163
Real wars don't stay
buried.

13
00:00:18,183 --> 00:00:19,101
Four climb out.

14
00:00:19,121 --> 00:00:20,644
The fifth is the
twist.

15
00:00:20,664 --> 00:00:21,794
One:
a border.

16
00:00:21,814 --> 00:00:23,958
The truce line still
splits the statue.

17
00:00:23,978 --> 00:00:25,445
Two:
cursed ground.

18
00:00:25,465 --> 00:00:26,933
Nobody has farmed
the burned field

19
00:00:26,953 --> 00:00:27,603
since.

20
00:00:27,623 --> 00:00:29,152
Three:
a stolen relic.

21
00:00:29,172 --> 00:00:30,909
The court still
keeps her torch.

22
00:00:30,929 --> 00:00:32,009
Four:
a grudge.

23
00:00:32,029 --> 00:00:33,934
Every child is
taught who to hate.

24
00:00:33,954 --> 00:00:34,684
Run it again.

25
00:00:34,704 --> 00:00:35,784
A thousand years.

26
00:00:35,804 --> 00:00:37,047
It's all still here.

27
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:37,747
Rule five?

28
00:00:37,767 --> 00:00:38,584
The claim.

29
00:00:38,604 --> 00:00:40,334
Nobody ever signed
the peace.

30
00:00:40,354 --> 00:00:41,632
That truce was a
pause.

31
00:00:41,652 --> 00:00:43,131
The war never ended.

32
00:00:43,151 --> 00:00:44,988
So hand one
character the pen.

33
00:00:45,008 --> 00:00:46,522
Fighting stops in a
day.

34
00:00:46,542 --> 00:00:48,942
A war ends when its
consequences do.

35
00:00:48,962 --> 00:00:50,824
What unresolved
conflict would your

36
00:00:50,844 --> 00:00:52,527
ancestors leave
behind?

37
00:00:52,547 --> 00:00:54,196
Part 32 of 50.

38
00:00:54,216 --> 00:00:56,796
Follow for part 33:
a god built from

39
00:00:56,816 --> 00:00:57,858
fear.
